  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to regulate emissions of volatile organic compounds (VOCs) from gasoline storage tanks, gasoline dispensing facilities, and cargo trucks in accordance with sections 182(b)(3) and 184 of the Clean Air Act, as amended.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or500.html"
